ValueSet: HIV.B.ET.DE18
Title: "Ethiopia HTS Visit Type ValueSet"
Description: "Value set containing the Ethiopia HTS visit code used to fix Encounter.type and Encounter.serviceType. This replaces the removed WHO HIV.B.DE4 option for the Ethiopia HTS Encounter profile."
